        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "feat(provider): add Unikraft Cloud service provider",
        "body": "## Summary\n\n- Add the built-in `unikraft-cloud` provider for creating, inspecting, listing, and deleting claimed Unikraft Cloud OCI-image microVM services.\n- Bind claims to the exact API endpoint and account UUID, with durable create/delete lifecycle states and cross-process operation/slug locks.\n- Reconcile ambiguous create and delete outcomes without adopting pre-existing resources or dropping ownership before strong absence proof.\n- Make list, status, stop, cleanup, and doctor fail closed on malformed inventory, duplicate ownership, scope drift, or identity mismatch.\n- Add an opt-in, zero-residue live smoke with exact baseline restoration, bounded emergency cleanup, secret redaction, and signal-safe process-group termination.\n- Document configuration, recovery behavior, cleanup semantics, and live validation; regenerate the provider matrix.\n\n## Verification\n\nExact local head: `842f0f707bcd0e58471a4e475bd1fc28dbce4171`\n\n- `go test -race ./...`\n- `go vet ./...`\n- `go run golang.org/x/tools/cmd/deadcode@v0.45.0 -test ./...`\n- `GOOS=windows GOARCH=amd64 go build -trimpath -o /tmp/crabbox-pr986-windows-amd64.exe ./cmd/crabbox`\n- `npm run format:check --prefix worker`\n- `npm run lint --prefix worker`\n- `npm run check --prefix worker`\n- `npm run check:node --prefix worker`\n- `npm test --prefix worker` — 918 passed, 3 skipped\n- `npm run build --prefix worker`\n- `npm run build:cloudflare-dynamic-workers --prefix worker`\n- `npm run build:node --prefix worker`\n- `node scripts/check-docker-base-images.mjs`\n- `bash -n scripts/live-unikraft-cloud-smoke.sh scripts/live-smoke.sh`\n- `shellcheck -x scripts/live-unikraft-cloud-smoke.sh`\n- `node --test scripts/live-unikraft-cloud-smoke.test.js` — 19 passed\n- `node scripts/generate-provider-matrix.mjs --check`\n- `./scripts/check-docs.sh` — 54 command docs, 74 providers, 214 Markdown files, docs site build\n- AutoReview: clean, no accepted or actionable findings\n- `git diff --check`\n- Exact-head hosted CI: all 12 checks passed — [main workflow](https://github.com/openclaw/crabbox/actions/runs/29057050620), [connector smoke workflow](https://github.com/openclaw/crabbox/actions/runs/29057050694)\n\n## Live proof\n\nExact-head credentialed Unikraft Cloud lifecycle proof is required before merge. The bundled smoke performs doctor, baseline inventory, create, ready status, claimed/all list validation, stop, strong absence checks, and exact baseline restoration without placing the token on argv or in proof logs.\n\nThanks @zozo123 for the provider contribution.\n",
